@protokol = http:
@adresa = localhost
@port = 7080

### GET zahtev
GET {{protokol}}//{{adresa}}:{{port}} HTTP/1.1

### GET zahtev sa dodatnim parametrima
GET {{protokol}}//{{adresa}}:{{port}}?param1=vrednost1&param2=vrednost2 HTTP/1.1


### Post zahtev sa JSON podacima
POST {{protokol}}//{{adresa}}:{{port}} HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "paja": "patak",
    "miki": "mis",
    "silja": "pas"
}
